OL,3,GNEWSARob Burrow would be proud of
OL,4,Aknighthood - Sinfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Kevin Sinfield has said his late
OL,7,Ffriend Rob Burrow would be "laughing"
OL,8,Fbut "enormously proud" to see him
OL,9,Freceive a knighthood.
OL,11,FThe former England rugby league captain
OL,12,Fand motor neurone disease (MND)
OL,13,Fcampaigner was one of 60 people to
OL,14,Freceive honours from the Prince of
OL,15,FWales at an investiture ceremony at
OL,16,FWindsor Castle earlier.
OL,18,FSir Kevin, who has raised more than
OL,19,F#11m for charity, received a knighthood
OL,20,Ffor his services to the MND community,
OL,21,Fas well as for services to league and
OL,22,Funion rugby.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
